@startuml
title US-03 Activity: Submit Borrow Request

start
:Select item & fill dates / reason;
if (Requester is owner?) then (Yes)
  :Reject (400 Cannot borrow own item);
elseif (Item status == AVAILABLE?) then (No)
  :Reject (409 Item unavailable);
else (Yes)
  :Create BorrowRequest (PENDING);
endif
stop
@enduml
